align="center">82</td><td align="center">2.00</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><p><sup>a</sup>Though the LOD score here is less than 1.5, the bivariate LOD score on aldx1&#x00026;pc2 in this area showed a significant increase compared with that of the univariate on aldx1 alone. Therefore, the LOD score on this area of the univariate analysis on pc2 is listed.</p></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></sec></back></article>